<title>PORTUGAL: EDP sale to boost Lisbon bourse turnover.</title>
<headline>EDP sale to boost Lisbon bourse turnover.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of up to 49 percent of Portuguese utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal is expected to boost turnover on Lisbon bourse by between 15 and 20 percent, research house ESR-Espirito Santo Research said.</p>
<p>&quot;The entry of EDP shares should bring an increase in turnover of between 15 and 20 percent (to the bourse),&quot; it said in a report dated this month.</p>
<p>The partial privatisation of EDP, which has a capital of 600 billion escudos, is expected to take place in May.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
